  "copy": {
    "headlineEn": "Updated West San Jose single-story home",
    "headlineZh": "西圣何塞焕新单层独栋",
    "summaryEn": "A move-in ready 3 bed, 2 bath home with a skylit modern kitchen, designer family-room built-ins, and a low-maintenance backyard for everyday California living.",
    "summaryZh": "可拎包入住的 3 房 2 浴住宅，拥有天窗采光的现代厨房、定制家庭厅收纳与低维护后院，适合轻松的加州日常生活。",
    "descriptionEn": "Charming and move-in ready, this beautifully maintained single-family home is filled with natural light and thoughtful updates. The modern kitchen brings together custom cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, a breakfast area, and a skylight, while the living and family spaces create a warm flow for everyday life and entertaining.\n\nThe spacious family room features designer built-ins, a large skylight, and a stylish electric fireplace. Outside, the low-maintenance backyard combines hardscape and lawn for relaxed California indoor-outdoor living. With wood-style flooring, double-pane windows, central heating, central A/C, and an attached 2-car garage, the home presents a polished West San Jose lifestyle.",
    "descriptionZh": "这是一套维护良好、可拎包入住的 West San Jose 独栋住宅，室内采光充足，并经过多处贴心更新。现代厨房配备定制橱柜、不锈钢电器、早餐区和天窗；客厅与家庭厅空间衔接自然，适合日常生活与待客。\n\n宽敞的家庭厅拥有设计感收纳柜、大天窗和时尚电壁炉。后院采用低维护设计，结合硬质铺装与草坪，营造轻松的加州室内外生活体验。木纹地板、双层玻璃窗、中央供暖、中央空调以及 2 车位附属车库，共同呈现精致便利的 West San Jose 居住方式。",
    "featureIntroEn": "The strongest story is practical polish: updated interiors, natural light in the spaces that matter most, and an easy-care backyard designed for real California everyday living.",
    "featureIntroZh": "这套房子的核心是“精致且实用”：室内经过更新，关键生活空间采光充足，后院易维护，真正适合加州日常居住。",
    "marketingSlogans": [
      {
        "en": "West San Jose calm, close to the places people actually use.",
        "zh": "West San Jose 的安静生活感，贴近日常真正会去的配套。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Skylit updates, single-story ease, and a backyard made for low-friction weekends.",
        "zh": "天窗采光的更新空间、单层便利动线、适合轻松周末的低维护后院。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A polished home base between Westgate errands, Santana Row evenings, and Campbell weekends.",
        "zh": "在 Westgate 日常采买、Santana Row 夜晚休闲与 Campbell 周末生活之间的精致居所。"
      }
    ]
  },
